      "briefTitle": "BAY81-8781, I.V. Aspirin in the Indication of Acute Coronary Syndrome (ACS)",
      "officialTitle": "A Prospective, Randomized, Verum Controlled, Open Label, Parallel Group Multi-center Phase III Clinical Trial to Demonstrate the Superiority of 500 or 250 mg Aspirin® i.v. (BAY 81-8781) Treatment Versus 300 mg Aspirin® N Tablets p.o. (BAY e4465A) in Patients With Acute Coronary Syndrome, Measured by Time Dependent Thromboxane Inhibition",
